articles.text:
a) “kurinda abasivili” bisobanura gukora imirimo
y’ubutabazi ivugwa hepfo, yaba yose cyangwa imwe
muri yo, igamije kurinda abaturage b’abasivili ibyago
by’intambara cyangwa ibiza no kubafasha gukira
ingaruka zabyo z’ako kanya, kimwe no kubaha
ibyangombwa bituma bakomeza kubaho.
Iyo mirimo ni iyi ikurikira:
i) kuburira ;
ii) guhungishwa;
iii) gushyiraho no gucunga ubwihisho;
iv) gushyira mu bikorwa ingamba zo kuzimya
amatara;
v) gutabara abari mu kaga;
vi) ibikorwa by’ubuvuzi, harimo ubutabazi
bw’ibanze, n’umurimo w’abanyamadini;
vii) kuzimya inkongi z’umuriro;
viii) gutahura no gushyira ibirango ku duce twateza
ibyago;
ix) gusukura uduce twandujwe n’izindi ngamba zisa
na byo;
x) gutanga icumbi no kugemurira abantu byihuse;
xi) gufasha mu gihe byihutirwa mu kugarura ituze no
kubungabunga umutekano mu turere twashegeshwe;
xii) gusana byihuse ibikorwa bifitiye abantu benshi
akamaro by’ingenzi;
viii) gushyingura byihuse abapfuye;
xiv) gufasha mu kubungabunga ibintu bya ngombwa
ku buzima;
xv) ibikorwa bya ngombwa byunganira ikorwa ry’iyo
ari yo yose mu mirimo ivugwa haruguru, bikubiyemo
ariko bitagarukira gusa ku iteganyabikorwa
n’imitunganyirize yabyo;
b) “inzego zishinzwe kurinda abasivili” rivuga ibigo
cyangwa izindi nzego z’imirimo zashyizweho
cyangwa zemerewe n’ubuyobozi bubifitiye ububasha
bw’igihugu kiri mu ntambara gukora iyo ari yo yose
mu mirimo ivugwa mu gace ka a), zishinzwe
cyangwa zikoreshwa gusa iyo mirimo;
c) “abakozi” b’inzego zishinzwe kurinda abasivili
risobanura abantu igihugu kiri mu ntambara
gishyiraho kugira ngo bakore gusa imirimo ivugwa
mu gace ka a), harimo abakozi ubuyobozi bubifitiye
ububasha bw’icyo gihugu bwashinze gusa
imiyoborere y’izo nzego;
d) “igikoresho” cy’inzego zishinzwe kurinda
abasivili risobanura igikoresho, ibyagemuwe
n’uburyo bwo gutwara abantu n’ibintu bikoreshwa
n’izo nzego mu gukora imirimo ivugwa mu gace ka
a).

cy’amahanga, uretse igihe bibaye ngombwa ku buryo
bw’igihe gito kubera impamvu za simusiga zijyanye
n’ubuzima cyangwa kuvuza umwana, cyangwa
izijyanye n’umutekano wabo, ahatari ku utaka
bw’igihugu bwafashwe. Iyo ababyeyi cyangwa
abishingizi bemewe n’amategeko b’abo bana
bashobora kuboneka, igihugu kigomba kubanza
kubasaba ko bacyemerera mu nyandiko guhungisha
abo bana. Iryo hungishwa rikurikiranwa n’igihugu
kirengezi kibyumvikanyeho ibihugu birebwa na ryo,
ni ukuvuga igihugu kirimo gihungisha abana
n’igihugu kibakira kimwe n’igihugu cyose
abahungishwa babereye abanegihugu. Uko byaba biri
kose, ibihugu bihanganye mu ntambara byose bifata
ingamba zose zishoboka zigamije kwirinda icyatuma
iryo hungishwa ridakorwa mu mutekano.
2.Igihe cyose ihungishwa rikozwe hakurikijwe
ibiteganywa mu gika cya mbere, buri mwana agomba
gukomeza guhabwa uburezi aho yahungishirijwe nta
guhagarara, harimo n’uburere mu by’idini
n’imbonezamuco buhuje n’ibyo ababyeyi be bifuza.
3.Mu rwego rwo korohereza abana bahungishijwe
hakurikijwe iyi ngingo gusubira mu miryango no mu
gihugu cyabo, abayobozi b’igihugu kibahungishije
n’abayobozi b’igihugu kibakira iyo bikwiriye,
bakorera buri mwana ikarita iriho ifoto
bakayoherereza Ishami rishinzwe Gushakisha
Abatandukanye n’Imiryango yabo rya Komite
Mpuzamahanga y’Umuryango Utabara Imbabare.
Igihe cyose bishoboka kandi bitateza umwana
ingorane, buri karita igomba kuba iriho amakuru
akurikira :
a)izina ry’ingereka ry’umwana;
b) izina bwite ry’umwana ;
c) igitsina cy’umwana;
d) ahantu n’itariki y’amavuko (cyangwa niba itariki
itagaragara ikigereranyo cy’imyaka);
e) Amazina ya se yose;
f) Amazina ya nyina yose n’izina ry’ingereka;
g) mwne wabo wa hafi;
h) ubwenegihugu bw’umwana;
i) ururimi kavukire rw’umwana n’izindi ndimi avuga;
j) aho umuryango w’umwana ubarizwa ;
k) umubare uwo ari wo wose uranga umwana;
l) imitere y’ubuzima bw’umwana;
m) ubwoko bw’amaraso y’umwana;
n) ibintu byose bimuranga;
o) itariki n’ahantu umwana yabonetse;
p) itariki n’ahantu umwana yaviriye mu gihugu;
q) idini ry’umwana niba arifite;
r) aderesi y’umwana mu gihugu cyamwakiriye;
s) niba umwana apfuye mbere yo gusubizwa iwabo,
itariki, ahantu n’impamvu zateye urupfu n’aho
yashyinguwe
UMUTWE WA III:ABANYAMAKURU
